    "title": "IJCAI-ECAI 2026 开幕：吴佳俊斩获「计算机与思想奖」，SMOTE 算法获首届时间检验奖",
    "summary": "经典大奖致敬AI先驱，14位青年学者站上全新焦点舞台，713篇主会论文把脉未来演进图景。 作者丨岑峰 马晓宁 当地时间 2026 年 8 月18日，第 35 届国际人工智能联合会议（IJCAI-ECAI 2026）在德国不莱梅拉开帷幕。作为历史最悠久、最具权威性的人工智能顶级学术会议之一，IJCAI 见证了 AI 半个多世纪的起伏与繁荣。今年，大会重回欧洲，不仅汇聚了全球顶尖的 AI 学者、产业领袖，更在 AGI 狂飙突进的当下，为全行业提供了一个反思基础理论、探讨技术落地的绝佳平台。AI科技评论小分队已抵达现场，为您发回开幕式及颁奖典礼的最新报道。01缅怀先驱与东道主致辞：AI 发展的传承与未来开幕式伊始，大会主席 Francesca Toni 登台致辞，正式宣布 IJCAI-ECAI 2026 开幕。本届大会受到了德国当地政府与科研机构的高规格重视。德国联邦研究、技术与空间部的 Alexandra-Gwyn Paetz 博士，以及不莱梅市长、参议院议长 Andreas Bovenschulte 分别发表了热情洋溢的欢迎致辞。Bovenschulte 的出席不仅展现了东道主对本次盛会",
    "raw_summary": "<section style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0px 16px; line-height: 1.75em; display: block;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a84351fe908e.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"width: 100%; display: inline-block; text-align: center; background-color: transparent;\" /></section><section style=\"padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px;\"><section style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; padding: 0px;\"><section style=\"width: 100%; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px;\"><section style=\"width: 100%; background: rgb(246, 248, 255); padding: 20px 0px 12px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;\"><section><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0px 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span><span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">经典大奖致敬AI先驱，14位青年学者站上全新焦点舞台，713篇主会论文把脉未来演进图景。</span></span></span></span></section><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><section style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span><br /></span></span></section></section></section><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 25px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #888888; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 作者丨</span></span><span><span style=\"color: #888888; font-weight: normal;\">岑峰 马晓宁</span></span><strong><span><strong><span><span><br /></span></span></strong></span></strong></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 25px; text-align: right; margin: 0px 16px;\"><strong><strong><span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></strong></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">当地时间 2026 年 8 月18日，第 35 届国际人工智能联合会议（IJCAI-ECAI 2026）在德国不莱梅拉开帷幕。作为历史最悠久、最具权威性的人工智能顶级学术会议之一，IJCAI 见证了 AI 半个多世纪的起伏与繁荣。今年，大会重回欧洲，不仅汇聚了全球顶尖的 AI 学者、产业领袖，更在 AGI 狂飙突进的当下，为全行业提供了一个反思基础理论、探讨技术落地的绝佳平台。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">AI科技评论小分队已抵达现场，为您发回开幕式及颁奖典礼的最新报道。</span></p><section><section><section style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;\"><section style=\"display: flex;\"><section><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a84352027481.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"display: block; height: auto !important; width: 38px !important; background-color: transparent;\" /></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\"><p style=\"font-size: 36px; color: #333333; line-height: 50px;\"><strong><span>01</span></strong></p><h2><strong><strong style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 25px; font-weight: bold; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\"><strong style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 25px; font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: #333333; line-height: 25px; font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">缅怀先驱与东道主致辞：</span></strong></strong></strong><strong><strong style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 25px; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 25px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 25px;\">AI 发展的传承与未来</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">开幕式伊始，大会主席 Francesca Toni 登台致辞，正式宣布 IJCAI-ECAI 2026 开幕。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">本届大会受到了德国当地政府与科研机构的高规格重视。德国联邦研究、技术与空间部的 Alexandra-Gwyn Paetz 博士，以及不莱梅市长、参议院议长 Andreas Bovenschulte 分别发表了热情洋溢的欢迎致辞。Bovenschulte 的出席不仅展现了东道主对本次盛会的极高规格重视，更突显了人工智能在当今国家和地区科技战略中的核心地位。</span></p><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a84352055f86.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"background-color: transparent; width: 100%;\" /></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">在开幕式上，大会也留下了一个特别的时刻。大屏幕上打出了“In Memoriam”的字样，全场共同缅怀了在今年离世的三位杰出科学家：Joe Halpern、Tony&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Hunter 以及 Lin Padgham。正是这些前辈学者的奠基性工作，才铺就了今天&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">AI 技术的繁荣之路。</span></p><section><section><section style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;\"><section style=\"display: flex;\"><section><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a8435208d557.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"display: block; height: auto !important; width: 38px !important; background-color: transparent;\" /></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\"><p style=\"font-size: 36px; color: #333333; line-height: 50px;\"><strong><span>02</span></strong></p><p style=\"width: 100%; padding: 0px 14px; display: flex; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: #333333; line-height: 25px; font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">斯坦福吴佳俊斩获 “计算机与思想奖”，华人青年学者闪耀顶会</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">开</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">幕式的重头戏历来是各大重磅奖项的颁发，IJCAI President Kate Larson宣布了今年的获奖者。</span></p><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a843520c0ed2.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"background-color: transparent; width: 100%;\" /></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">其中，备受瞩目的<span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">“计算机与思想奖”（The Computers and Thought Award）</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span>颁给了斯坦福大学助理教授&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">吴佳俊（Jiajun Wu）</span></span></strong><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">。</span></span></p><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a84352106d99.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"background-color: transparent; width: 100%;\" /></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">大会在颁奖词中高度评价了他的工作：“以表彰他在计算机视觉、生成式 AI 和机器人技术领域的奠基性贡献，他将神经与符号表示相融合，致力于构建能够理解物理世界并与之互动的机器。”</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #888888;\">（</span></span><em><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #888888;\">In recognition of his foundational contributions across computer vision, generative AI, and robotics, uniting neural and symbolic representations to build machines that understand and interact with the physical world.</span></span></em><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #888888;\">）</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">“计算机与思想奖”被誉为人工智能领域青年学者的最高荣誉，极具“明日之星”的风向标意义。该奖项最初由 Edward Feigenbaum 和 Julian Feldman 所编著的《Computers and Thought》一书的版税设立，目前由 IJCAI 基金支持。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">翻开该奖项的历史名册，可谓星光熠熠。众多我们熟知的 AI 泰斗级人物都曾在此刻下名字，包括 Tom Mitchell (1983年)、 Rodney Brooks (1991年)、Stuart Russell（1995年）、Daphne Koller（2001年）以及吴恩达（Andrew Ng，2009年）等。值得骄傲的是，近年来华人学者在该奖项上的表现尤为亮眼，方飞（Fei Fang，2021年）、李博（Bo Li，2022年）、陈品谕（Pin-Yu Chen，2023年）等青年才俊先后获此殊荣，吴佳俊的获奖再次印证了华人青年学者在国际 AI 核心舞台上的强劲实力。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">除了吴佳俊外，大会还颁发了其他几项极具分量的终身与卓越成就奖项：</span></p><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\">卓越研究奖（Award for Research Excellence）：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;授予了帝国理工学院的 Nicholas R. Jennings 教授。</span></p></li></ul><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a8435214a432.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"background-color: transparent; width: 100%;\" /></section><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\">约翰·麦卡锡奖（John McCarthy Award）：</span></span></strong><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">授予了哈佛大学的 David C. Parkes 教授。</span></p></li></ul><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a84352187fd4.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"background-color: transparent; width: 100%;\" /></section><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\">唐纳德·E·沃克杰出服务奖（Donald E. Walker Distinguished Service Award）：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;授予了 Christian Bessiere。我国人工智能著名学者杨强在2023年也曾获这一奖项。</span></p></li></ul><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a843521b7eb6.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"background-color: transparent; width: 100%;\" /></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">此外，知名人工智能期刊 AIJ（Artificial Intelligence Journal）也在大会现场重磅颁发了年度奖项。</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">AIJ 创刊于 1970 年，是人工智能领域历史最悠久、最具声望的顶级期刊。AIJ 与 IJCAI 渊源深厚——AIJ 的日常运营由 IJCAI 旗下的 AIJ 部门（AIJ Division）提供直接的财务与行政支持，双方共同构成了全球 AI 研究最核心的学术阵地。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">在本届大会上，公布了备受瞩目的&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">AIJ 2026 经典论文奖（AIJ 2026 Classic Paper Award）</span></span></strong><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">：</span></span></p><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a84352206e98.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"background-color: transparent; width: 100%;\" /></section><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">获奖论文：</span></strong><em><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Nonmonotonic reasoning, preferential models and cumulative logics</span></em></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">作者：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Sarit Kraus, Daniel Lehmann, and Menachem Magidor</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">发表信息：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Artificial Intelligence Vol 44, pages 167-207, July 1990.</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">获奖意义：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;这篇发表于 36 年前的旷世之作，在非单调推理、优先模型以及累积逻辑等 AI 基础逻辑理论方向做出了开创性贡献。历经三十余载的岁月检验，它依然对当今的 AI 复杂推理研究有着不可磨灭的深远影响。</span></p></li></ul><section><section><section style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;\"><section style=\"display: flex;\"><section><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a84352242a4c.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"display: block; height: auto !important; width: 38px !important; background-color: transparent;\" /></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\"><p style=\"font-size: 36px; color: #333333; line-height: 50px;\"><strong><span>03</span></strong></p><h2><strong><strong style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 25px; font-weight: bold; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\"><strong style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 25px; font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; color: #333333; line-height: 25px; font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">重磅论文奖项揭晓：</span></strong></strong></strong><strong><strong style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 25px; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 25px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 25px;\">经典重采样算法 SMOTE&nbsp;</span></strong></strong></strong><strong><strong style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 25px; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 25px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 25px;\">获首届时间检验奖</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">在论文奖项环节，大会颁发了 IJCAI-JAIR 相关的两大重磅荣誉：</span></p><section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">▎</span></span><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7;\">2026 IJCAI-JAIR 最佳论文奖（Best Paper Prize）</span></span></strong></p></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a8435228b83d.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"background-color: transparent; width: 100%;\" /></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">该奖项自 2003 年设立，每年颁发给过去 5 年内发表在 JAIR（Journal of Artificial Intelligence Research）上的杰出文章，获奖者将得到由 IJCAI 提供的 500 美元奖金。 今年的最佳论文颁给了：</span></p><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">论文：</span></strong><em><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">The computational complexity of understanding binary classifier decisions</span></em></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">作者：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Stephan Wäldchen, Jan MacDonald, Sascha Hauch, and Gitta Kutyniok</span></p></li></ul><section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">▎</span></span><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7;\">2026 JAIR 时间检验奖（Test of Time Award）</span></span></strong></p></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a843522cf66e.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"background-color: transparent; width: 100%;\" /></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">这是今年大会全新设立的奖项</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">，旨在表彰发表在 JAIR 上超过 10 年且对领域产生深远长期影响的杰出论文。首届时间检验奖颁给了一项在机器学习领域无人不知的经典工作：</span></p><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">论文：</span></strong><em><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">SMOTE: Synthetic Minority Over-sampling Technique</span></em></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">作者：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Nitesh V. Chawla, Kevin W. Bowyer, Lawrence O. Hall, and W. Philip Kegelmeyer</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">获奖理由：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;该工作解决了机器学习中如何平衡数据集的经典问题。SMOTE 提出的通过在特征空间插值生成少数类样本的方法，已成为处理数据不平衡最基础、应用最广泛的方法之一，至今仍对该领域产生着广泛而持续的影响。</span></p></li></ul><section><section><section style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;\"><section style=\"display: flex;\"><section><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a8435231a839.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"display: block; height: auto !important; width: 38px !important; background-color: transparent;\" /></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\"><p style=\"font-size: 36px; color: #333333; line-height: 50px;\"><strong><span>04</span><span><br /></span></strong></p><h2><strong><strong style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 25px; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 25px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 25px;\">论文接收数据公布：主会接收 713 篇，</span></strong></strong></strong><strong><strong style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 25px; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 25px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 25px;\">全新推出“早期职业焦点演讲”</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">随后，程序委员会主席（PC）Diego Calvanese 登台，向全场报告了本届 IJCAI 的论文接收与审稿情况。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">在经历了大模型爆发初期的投稿狂潮后，今年的论文数据呈现出更加稳健的态势：</span></p><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\">总投稿数据：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;大会整体接收论文 858 篇（总投稿量 6342 篇）。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\">Main Track（主赛道）：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;接收 713 篇（有效评审投稿 5233 篇）。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">对比往年主赛道数据：2025年（接收1015/投稿5348）；2024年（791/5651）；2023年（643/4566）。</span></em></p></li></ul><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a843523666b6.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"background-color: transparent; width: 100%;\" /></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">今年大会还设立了&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">5 大特别赛道（Special Tracks）</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">，具体接收情况如下：</span></p><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">AI4Tech: 接收 25 篇（投稿 154 篇）</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">AI and Health: 接收 47 篇（投稿 236 篇）</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">AI and Robotics: 接收 11 篇（投稿 45 篇）</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">AI for Social Good: 接收 52 篇（投稿 176 篇）</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Human-Centred AI: 接收 10 篇（投稿 82 篇）</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">其他赛道方面，Survey Track 接收 45 篇（投稿 215 篇），Journal Track 接收 6 篇，Sister Conference Track 接收 17 篇。</span></p><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260818/6a843523a4f23.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\" style=\"background-color: transparent; width: 100%;\" /></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">值得一提的是，Diego Calvanese 特别介绍了今年全新推出的&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">Early Career Spotlight Talks（早期职业焦点演讲）</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">。这是 IJCAI&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">首次面向全社区进行公开提名招募（First time an open call for nominations）</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">，最终由评委会精挑细选出 14 位极具潜力的青年学者，他们将在接下来的几天内为大会带来精彩的前沿报告。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">开幕式的各项议程及数据公布完毕后，全场气氛被推向了新的高潮。随着主持人介绍完毕，荣获本届“卓越研究奖”的 Nicholas R. Jennings 教授在热烈的掌声中登台，正式开始了大会的首场重磅 Keynote 演讲（AI科技评论将会进行全文整理）。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">属于 IJCAI-ECAI 2026 的学术盛宴，由此正式拉开帷幕。AI科技评论将在德国不莱梅现场，持续为您带来更多前沿学术报道与大咖专访，敬请期待！</span></p><section><section><section style=\"width: 100%; padding: 0 10px;\"><section style=\"width: 100%; display: flex;\"><section style=\"width: 100%;\"><section style=\"width: 100%; background: rgb(246, 248, 255); text-align: center; padding: 7px 10px 11px 11px;\"><section style=\"width: 100%; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">IJCAI 2026 要来了，你还在单打独斗？</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">为了方便大家抱团交流、互通会议消息，我们专门建了</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">IJCAI 2026 参会群</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">！进群你会解锁这些「福利」</span>?</span></strong></p><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">会议情报站</span></span><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">投稿 DDL、格式规范、评审进度……关键节点第一时间送达，再也不怕错过 deadline，投稿准备稳稳的。</span></span></strong></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">同行茶话会</span></span><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">天南海北的同行都在群里，聊心得、碰思路、攒人脉，科研路上我们同行。</span></span></strong></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">前沿补给站</span></span><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">最新研究成果、热点方向实时同步，结合会议主题帮你捋清投稿脉络，给论文灵感加满油。</span></span></strong></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">现场后援团：</span></span><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span><span style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">（会议期间专属开启）：</span></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">到了会场也不用慌——</span></span></span></span></strong><span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0px 16px 8px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">路线导航</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">：</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-style: italic;\">场馆分布、报告厅怎么走，群里随时问；</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0px 16px 8px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">议题共读</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.034em; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">：</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-style: italic;\">热门 session、Keynote 现场探讨，错过也能追；</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0px 16px 8px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">Poster 汇编</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.034em; font-size: 15px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">：</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-style: italic;\">现场海报精华整理，一键收藏不遗漏；</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 0px 16px 8px; line-hei